[/tikz]
(b) The initial value is:
$\begin{aligned}Q(0)&=30-10e^0\\&=20.\end{aligned}$
Here $A<0$ and $k>0$. The curve starts below $Q=30$, decreases and becomes progressively steeper. It falls without bound, so there is no finite limiting value. The line $Q=30$ is not an asymptote as $t\to\infty$ in either case.
